  <!-- Beliefs -->
  <section class="ed-beliefs" aria-label="Beliefs">
    <div class="ed-beliefs__text">
      <div class="ed-beliefs__head">
        <span class="ed-lbl">Beliefs</span>
        <h2>What I optimize for.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="ed-beliefs__copy">
        <p>Security only works when the architecture actually survives contact with a <em>live adversary</em>. Building resilient systems means tracking behavioral tradecraft instead of just chasing indicators, treating trust as something that must be earned continuously. A network will only hold up under pressure if the environment remains <em>completely legible</em>.</p>
        <p>Ultimately, this profession is just figuring out how things break and engineering them to be much harder to crack. I have always loved that part.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ed-beliefs__imgs">
      <div class="ed-frame ed-frame--a ed-bento" role="img" aria-label="Cybersecurity snapshot: an animated dot-matrix eagle tracked by a reframing grid, live threat intelligence from OTX and CIRCL MISP, six security certifications, and a rotating MITRE ATT&amp;CK technique spotlight">
        <div class="ed-bento__cell ed-bento__pixels">
